  "description": "Single storey front extension; replacement of existing flat roof with a pitched roof; external alterations; access, parking and landscaping",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed single storey front extension, replacement of the existing flat roof with a pitched roof, and associated external alterations would result in a form of development that is out of character, visually bulky, and harmful to the established character of the area. The cumulative scale, massing and roof form of the proposal would cause the building to read as a standalone dwellinghouse encroaching towards the street frontage, rather than retaining the subordinate appearance of an outbuilding as originally designed as is typical within the surrounding context. Therefore, the development would be contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 of the London plan and GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021-2041.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The forward projection and increased visual prominence would disrupt the prevailing building line, go against the established urban grain and undermine the spatial openness and pattern of development that contributes to the character of the street scene. As a result, the development would detract from character and appearance of the area and would be contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D3 of the London plan and GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021-2041.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
